{"meta":{"id":"tt0102011","type":"movie","name":"Él dijo, ella dijo","imdb_id":"tt0102011","description":"Dan y Lorie, dos jóvenes periodistas, con muy pocas cosas en común, son compañeros de trabajo. Sea cual sea el asunto a debatir, sus puntos de vista son diametralmente opuestos. Esta explosiva relación lleva a un avispado productor televisivo a contratarlos para que hagan juntos un programa: \"El dijo, ella dijo\". El trabajo en común hace que, a pesar de sus divergencias, entre ellos surja el amor.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0102011.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1y43OB6R4vfBKEuVpGxyFENMAqh.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c4MW9yEhywQNpQ34u64ij5zhard.png","genres":["Comedia","Drama","Romance"],"releaseInfo":"1991","released":"1991-02-22T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"115 min","imdbRating":"5.7","country":"United States of America","cast":["Kevin Bacon","Elizabeth Perkins","Nathan Lane","Anthony LaPaglia","Sharon Stone","Stanley Anderson","Charlayne Woodard","Danton Stone","Phil Leeds","Rita Karin","Paul Butler","Erika Alexander","Ashley Gardner","Michael Harris","Damien Leake","Constance Shulman","Leon Russom","Steven Gilborn","Dana Andersen","Petie Perkins","Hope Miles","Bruce MacVittie","George Martin","Tanya Berezin","Maury Efrems","Claudia Silver","David Cale","Rick Warner","Elizabeth Brower","Alycea Baylis"],"director":["Marisa Silver","Ken Kwapis"],"writer":["Brian Hohlfeld"],"trailers":[{"source":"-fhsJJNuxBA","type":"Trailer","name":"He Said She Said - Trailer","ytId":"-fhsJJNuxBA","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"-fhsJJNuxBA","title":"He Said She Said - Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"5.7","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt0102011"},{"name":"Comedia","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?genre=Comedia"},{"name":"Drama","category":"Genres","url":"stremi